      "labelStart": null,
      "labelEnd": "4",
      "words": 2247,
      "summary": {
        "text": "The front matter of Web Annex A to WHO's poliovirus containment guidance, which gives country- and area-specific poliovirus data as of April 2023 (WHO/POLIO/23.02). It contains the title and copyright pages with the CC BY-NC-SA 3.0 IGO licence, a contents list and abbreviations. It then explains how the data table should be read, including how dates of wild and vaccine-derived poliovirus circulation and of oral polio vaccine use were recorded. Notes clarify which samples count as potentially infectious material for each virus type, and that the month of last trivalent OPV use was set to December where only the year was known.",
        "status": "draft"
      },
