      ],
      "extract": "Table A2.1. Country- and area-specific poliovirus circulation data, April 2023 update No. Country or area 1. WPV/VDPV potentially infectious material dates 2. OPV2/nOPV2/Sabin2 potentially infectious material dates (Must mitigate now) WPV1/cVDPV1 WPV2/cVDPV2 (Must contain now) WPV3/cVDPV3 (Must contain now) 1. Afghanistan1 Endemic (1) • Until Nov 1997 (2, 3) • Jun 2010 – Mar 2013 (1) • Jan 2020 – Jul 2021 (1) Until",
